<dispatchitem code="00024880.0001001" func-code="25-24-02" item-list-nbr="02" revdate="2022-11-16T00:00:00"><title>Overhead Stowage Compartment (<abb>OHSC</abb>)</title><ditembody nb-installed="-"><dispcond code="00024880.0001001.001" dispcond-id="D11801" dispcond-label="A" lid="N.00024880.0001001.001"><title>One latch is inoperative</title><normal-dispcond nb-required="-" rectification-interval="D"><placard/><remark><requirementblock><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.002" req-id="R11802"><maintenance-ref><taskref chap-nbr="25" func="040" product="AMM Task" sect-nbr="24" seq="801" subj-nbr="00"/></maintenance-ref><qualifiers><qualifier value="CREW_OPS"/><qualifier value="COMMERCIAL"/></qualifiers><para code="00024880.0001001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.003">One latch
may be inoperative per compartment door provided that:</para></requirement><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.004"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.005" req-id="R11803"><para code="00024880.0001001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.006">The affected stowage compartment is secured in the closed position,
and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.007"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.008" req-id="R11804"><para code="00024880.0001001.004" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.009">The affected stowage compartment is placarded "DO NOT USE",
and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.010"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.011" req-id="R11805"><para code="00024880.0001001.005" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.012">The affected stowage compartment is not used for stowage of any items
except for those permanently affixed, and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.022"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.023" req-id="R11810"><para code="00024880.0001001.010" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.024">If the <abb>OHSC</abb> has several doors with only one compartment
behind, all doors of the compartment are secured closed, and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.025"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.026" req-id="R11811"><para code="00024880.0001001.011" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.027">The rest of the elements of the affected <abb>OHSC</abb> are operational,
and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.028"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.029" req-id="R11812"><para code="00024880.0001001.012" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.030">Any emergency equipment located in the affected stowage compartment
is considered inoperative unless moved to a different stowage compartment
with a placard indicating the relocated emergency equipment.</para><note code="00024880.0001001.013" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.031"><para layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.032">If associated emergency equipment
cannot be relocated, refer to associated <abb>MMEL</abb> item.</para></note></requirement></addrequ></requirementblock></remark></normal-dispcond></dispcond><dispcond code="00024880.0001001.006" dispcond-id="D11806" dispcond-label="B" lid="N.00024880.0001001.013"><title>Bin Removed (for <abb>OHSC</abb> with <if-installed>Movable
