placarded "DO NOT USE", and</para></requirement></addrequ><addrequ lid="N.00024880.0001001.053"><requirement lid="N.00024880.0001001.054" req-id="R11820"><para code="00024880.0001001.023" layer="1" lid="N.00024880.0001001.055">The affected stowage compartment is not used for stowage of any items,
